catflow 0.8
1. Read Text  ticket.txt
2. Classify   Ministral 3B; "Type? tags: billing, technical, other"
   -> { billing: 3 | technical: 5 | other: 6 }
3. <list billing_agent>                        # reads billing-kb.index inside
     1. Read Index               billing-kb.index
     2. Think        (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; tools: search, calculate, final; max_visits=8; on_budget=final
        -> { search: call 3 | calculate: call 5 | final: resume }
     3. Embed                    BGE-M3
     4. Retrieve     (1,3)       top_k=5
        resume
     5. Calculate
        resume
4. Rewrite    Ministral 3B; "policy-safe tone"
   -> 7
5. <list docs_agent>                           # reads docs-kb.index inside
     1. Read Index               docs-kb.index
     2. Think        (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; tools: search, calculate, final; max_visits=8; on_budget=final
        -> { search: call 3 | calculate: call 5 | final: resume }
     3. Embed                    BGE-M3
     4. Retrieve     (1,3)       top_k=5
        resume
     5. Calculate
        resume
   -> 7
6. Answer     Qwen3 8B; "acknowledge; summarize for a human"
7. Save Text  reply-draft.txt
